          "text": "will go counterclockwise. Each of them"
        },
        {
          "t": 46.5,
          "text": "partnered with a healer arranged in"
        },
        {
          "t": 48,
          "text": "their tower. For the healers in range,"
        },
        {
          "t": 50.1,
          "text": "things are a little bit more"
        },
        {
